  "description": "“I will do whatever it takes to keep you here on this wretched earth.” \n\n“Still, Yun-woo, we might actually be able to pay the heating bills this winter.” \n\nYun-woo and I were poor. The only thing we had to give each other was our warmth. To survive the winter, we worked at night and slept during the day. Worn down by a life lived only for survival, we eventually broke up, only to meet again three years later—both of us pushed even further to the edge of the cliff\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \nR19: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13926253)  \nR15: [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=13926252)",
